- ⌘↵ takes what was typed as the address bar would, even when matched
  tabs push the search row to the bottom.
- The footer shows each key on a keycap beside its action, drops the
  arrow and Escape hints and puts the tab count on the right.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
